#
# What the image builds leave out of their context, the repository root
# (deploy/server/Dockerfile and deploy/postgres/Dockerfile). Each build
# installs its own dependencies, so no node_modules, build output, secret or
# env file goes in. Docker matches each line from the root of the context,
# not in every folder as git does, so a line for a file in any folder starts
# with **. The deploy guard (scripts/guards/deploy.ts) checks the lines for
# the secrets and the env files.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
deploy/secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
